    "body": "Problem:\r\nw_float_is_info conflates a window's role with its floating layout,\r\nwhich are orthogonal properties.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nReplace w_float_is_info with a w_kind enum for the window's role.\r\n\r\n",
